  <h1>Ember Blade</h1>
  <p>
    <strong>Feudal Japan, at the end of the clan wars.</strong> Villages burn,
    the sword is still the law, and there are no guns. Ryu, 19, the last
    fire-sword swordsman, buried his katana three years ago and swore never
    to use its fire again. Then the man who burned his village came back.
  </p>
  <p>
    Drawn in retro 1990s anime style: bold black outlines, faded VHS
    colours, film grain, and close-ups on eyes and blades.
  </p>

  <h2>Locked story rules</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Ryu's fire can only be used <strong>once a day</strong> — and every
    use burns a part of his own life.</li>
    <li>In Episode 1, Ryu may only light his fire in the <strong>final
    scene</strong>, never before.</li>
    <li>Kaito <strong>must not lose</strong> in Episode 1.</li>
    <li>Aiko <strong>must not die</strong>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Characters</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Ryu — 19</h3>
      <p>The last fire-sword swordsman. Messy black hair tied back, torn
      dark-blue kimono, katana with a red handle. He came home a farmer.
      He left a legend.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Kaito</h3>
      <p>Armored warlord in black, ice-blue blade. Once a fellow student
      of Ryu's master — the one who betrayed him.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Aiko — 17</h3>
      <p>Ryu's adopted younger sister. She hid in the old temple holding
      the katana Ryu buried — and she knows what the fire costs.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Episodes</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Episode 1 — The Village That Burned Twice</h3>
    <p>Ryu walks home through the bamboo forest at sunset — and finds his
    village burning for the second time.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/films/ember-blade/episode-1/">Read Episode 1</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Episode 2 — The Fire Remembers</h3>
    <p>Ryu's fire wakes for the first time in three years. He frees
    Aiko — and Kaito draws his ice sword.</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="/films/ember-blade/episode-2/">Read Episode 2</a></p>
  </div>
